  LICENSE.NXROBO), https://github.com/NXROBO/sagittarius_ws

  Changes from the original sgr532.urdf.xacro:
    - ROS 2 layout: ROS 1 <transmission> tags removed
    - link names take an optional prefix (default none) instead of "sgr532/"
    - joint_gripper_right mimics joint_gripper_left (one gripper command)
    - link_grasping_frame inertia removed (upstream had a stray 1.55 kg mass
      at -0.29 m, which would corrupt any dynamics or Gazebo use)
    - joint effort limits set from servo ratings instead of the 100 N·m placeholder
    - optional fixed "world" mount frame with a configurable pose

  Joint order matches the Unitree-K1-SDK driver 1:1 (radians, no sign flips):
    joint1 shoulder_pan, joint2 shoulder_lift, joint3 elbow_flex,
    joint4 wrist_roll,   joint5 wrist_flex,    joint6 gripper_roll
-->
